# Server environment variables

Copy the names below into the Vercel project (Production + Preview) and into
Google Apps Script → Project Settings → Script Properties. Never commit values.

## Required

| Variable | Purpose |
|---|---|
| `SARI_SESSION_SECRET` | HMAC key for session cookies. Minimum 32 chars. Generate with `openssl rand -hex 32`. |
| `SARI_PASSWORD_HASH` | `scrypt:<saltHex>:<hashHex>` (preferred) or a legacy 64-char SHA-256 hex. |
| `SARI_LOGIN_EMAIL` | Optional. Defaults to `md@divyanshicapital.com`. |

Generate a scrypt hash:

```bash
node -e "const c=require('crypto');const s=c.randomBytes(16);const h=c.scryptSync(process.argv[1],s,64);console.log('scrypt:'+s.toString('hex')+':'+h.toString('hex'))" 'your-password'
```

## Model routing

| Variable | Purpose |
|---|---|
| `GEMINI_API_KEY` | Primary cloud model. (`MALLIK_API_KEY`, `GOOGLE_API_KEY`, `AI_STUDIO_API_KEY` also accepted.) |
| `SARI_SHARED_SECRET` | HMAC secret shared with Apps Script. Minimum 32 chars. Required for the Apps Script tier. |
| `SARI_APPS_SCRIPT_URL` | Optional override of the deployment URL. |

## Integrations (all optional)

| Variable | Purpose |
|---|---|
| `SARI_TELEGRAM_BOT_TOKEN` | Optional. Telegram bot token for push alerts. |
| `SARI_TELEGRAM_CHAT_ID` | Optional. Target chat/group ID. |
| `SARI_SUPABASE_URL` | Supabase project URL. |
| `SARI_SUPABASE_KEY` | Supabase key (service role stays server-side only). |

Until Telegram is configured, lead alerts are recorded in the in-app **Alerts**
feed (installed PWA or `/alerts`). Nothing is silently dropped.

## Apps Script Script Properties

| Property | Purpose |
|---|---|
| `SARI_SHARED_SECRET` | Must match the Vercel value exactly. |
| `MALLIK_API_KEY` or `GEMINI_API_KEY` | Model key used by `ai_infer`. |
| `SARI_MEMORY_VAULT` | Written by the backend; do not set by hand. |
